## Compensation Analysis Dashboard

### Overview

This folder contains the dashboard deliverables for the Compensation Equity Analysis project.

## Purpose

The dashboard presents compensation metrics and comparisons across employee groups to help identify patterns that may 
require further investigation.

## Tools
Excel Power Query
Files

The folder will contain a screenshot of the completed dashboard and, where appropriate, the Power Query report file.

Important Note

Differences in average salary do not, by themselves, establish pay inequity. Results should be interpreted in the context
of relevant employee and job characteristics.
